### 图书API测试

### 获取所有图书
GET http://localhost:3001/books

### 创建新图书
POST http://localhost:3001/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试图书",
  "author": "测试作者",
  "isbn": "978-7-1111-1111-1",
  "publisher": "测试出版社",
  "publishDate": "2022-01-01",
  "category": "fiction",
  "tags": ["测试", "示例"],
  "status": "unread",
  "rating": 0,
  "notes": "这是一本测试图书",
  "startDate": "",
  "finishDate": "",
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/seed/test-book/200/300.jpg"
}

### 获取单本图书 (需要替换为实际的图书ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/books/63a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345

### 搜索图书
GET http://localhost:3001/books/search/测试

### 根据分类获取图书
GET http://localhost:3001/books/category/fiction

### 根据状态获取图书
GET http://localhost:3001/books/status/unread

### 更新图书 (需要替换为实际的图书ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/books/63a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "read",
  "rating": 4,
  "notes": "已阅读完成，内容不错"
}

### 获取统计信息
GET http://localhost:3001/books/statistics/summary

### 删除图书 (需要替换为实际的图书ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/books/63a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345